1
00:00:00,299 --> 00:00:02,009
(Amy:)I'm so glad you like it.

2
00:00:02,168 --> 00:00:03,838
(Sheldon:)I'm prepared to say I love it,

3
00:00:04,003 --> 00:00:06,673
(Sheldon:)as soon as I confirm there
are no hobos aboard.

4
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:12,083
(Sheldon:)OK.

5
00:00:13,079 --> 00:00:15,029
(Leonard(on phone):)Raj, I got it.

6
00:00:15,448 --> 00:00:16,758
(Leonard(on phone):)Bye.

7
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:20,301
(Leonard(on phone):)That was your daddy.

8
00:00:21,287 --> 00:00:24,857
(Leonard(on phone):)He wanted me to say that he misses--
Why am I doing this?

9
00:00:26,325 --> 00:00:28,205
Happy Valentine's Day!

10
00:00:28,361 --> 00:00:30,531
(Leonard:)Flowers and chocolates?

11
00:00:30,696 --> 00:00:33,196
(Leonard:)Somebody's trying
to get me out of my panties.

12
00:00:34,433 --> 00:00:36,773
(Penny:)Don't be surprised if you
find five chocolates missing

13
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:38,976
(Penny:)and three gross coconut
ones with a bite taken out.

14
00:00:40,773 --> 00:00:42,683
(Penny:)It came that way when I bought it.

15
00:00:43,276 --> 00:00:44,986
(Leonard:)Got you a little something, too.

16
00:00:45,144 --> 00:00:47,484
Oh, jewelry!

17
00:00:48,381 --> 00:00:51,161
Oh, my God. Lakers tickets?!

18
00:00:53,886 --> 00:00:55,486
(Leonard:)It gets better. Instead of me,
you can take someone

19
00:00:55,655 --> 00:00:58,065
(Leonard:)-who will actually enjoy it.
-Ohh!

20
00:00:58,357 --> 00:01:00,737
(Penny:)You are the best boyfriend ever.

